<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Take It Slow (Remix) (Bonus Track)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Majestic J, Maejor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Ups &amp; Downs</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7jSqQPzecPGrcRUJr6ddFB</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.500" end="00:11.040">Uh, yeah, yeah (I know what she want)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.040" end="00:13.920">Lil' mama want her hair pulled</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.920" end="00:15.570">Legs pushed back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.570" end="00:18.410">Only like a Rottweiler in the kitty cat</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.410" end="00:21.830">She want it wild, shawty wanna scream (wo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.830" end="00:24.720">Want it from the front, back, side, and in between</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.720" end="00:27.830">Want it all the time, she a feign</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.830" end="00:31.010">So good, I see it in my dreams</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.010" end="00:33.540">She wanna arch her back when I hit it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.540" end="00:35.980">When I do it mama wanna holla get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.980" end="00:39.100">She said take it slow, put it down on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.100" end="00:42.280">I said jump on it, ride like a pony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.280" end="00:45.280">Lights down low, time to get naughty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.280" end="00:48.250">Lights down low, t-t-time to get naughty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.250" end="00:51.440">Take it slow, put it down on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.440" end="00:54.590">Baby jump on it, ride like a pony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.590" end="00:57.540">Lights down low, time to get naughty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.540" end="01:00.510">Lights down low, l-l-l-lights down low</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.510" end="01:03.890">And we gon' get it on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.890" end="01:07.060">We gon' get it on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.060" end="01:10.030">I know what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.030" end="01:13.020">Yeah, I know what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.020" end="01:15.640">Lil mama, hol' up where they do that at?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.640" end="01:18.780">Wanted more than one round, that's a fact</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.780" end="01:22.040">Ding ding, body shots from the back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.040" end="01:25.080">Shawty wanna do an all night match (night match)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.080" end="01:26.840">Ready to rumble baby (rumble baby)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.840" end="01:29.340">She wanna get a kiss (she wanna get a kiss)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.340" end="01:31.590">She ain't talkin' bout her lips (talkin' bout her lips)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.590" end="01:35.590">Lil mama want somebody to take control-ol (want somebody to take control-ol)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.590" end="01:37.650">She say I'm out cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.650" end="01:39.150">She said take it slow, put it down on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.940" end="01:43.910">I said jump on it, ride like a pony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.910" end="01:47.430">Lights down low, time to get naughty (yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.430" end="01:50.660">Lights down low, t-t-time to get naughty (Majestic J)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.660" end="01:53.250">Take it slow, put it down on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.250" end="01:56.350">Baby jump on it, ride like a pony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.350" end="01:59.300">Lights down low, time to get naughty (uh, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.300" end="02:02.460">Lights down low, l-l-l-lights down low</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.460" end="02:05.500">And we gon' get it on (Yeah, yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.500" end="02:08.690">We gon' get it on (uh, uh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.690" end="02:11.660">I know what you want (yeah, Majestic J)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.660" end="02:15.580">Yeah, I know what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.580" end="02:18.170">You can see her from far boom boom boom boom-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.170" end="02:19.730">Bills on neck, Bitch I'm a car with big suspensions</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.730" end="02:22.320">I'm a legend, she's number one on my book, wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.320" end="02:23.870">Did I forget to mention</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.870" end="02:26.660">I'm hooked to her love, her eyes, her bueaty in the sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.660" end="02:29.150">She does it well super independent with style</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.150" end="02:31.360">Hold me I be rollin' up with her one day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.360" end="02:33.710">'Cause I got so much swag with the gentleman swag (swag)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.710" end="02:35.860">Left and right blowin' up like dynamite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.860" end="02:38.780">The might in me that's might all these fakes all up under me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.780" end="02:40.280">Tryna be seductive so wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.260" end="02:42.850">Take it slow, put it down on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.850" end="02:45.830">I said jump on it, ride like a pony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.830" end="02:48.840">Lights down low, time to get naughty (wo, wo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.840" end="02:52.200">Lights down low, t-t-time to get naughty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.200" end="02:54.980">Take it slow, put it down on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.980" end="02:58.040">Baby jump on it, ride like a pony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.040" end="03:01.090">Lights down low, time to get naughty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:01.090" end="03:04.530">Lights down low, l-l-l-lights down low</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.530" end="03:07.680">And we gon' get it on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.680" end="03:10.510">We gon' get it on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.510" end="03:13.360">I know what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.360" end="03:21.360">Yeah, I know what you want (aye, ah, ah, ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.550" end="03:23.160">Hey Maejor</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:23.160" end="03:27.160" /></div></body></tt>